      <p class="hint">Repos to copy from: GSAP MotionPathPlugin (now free, every plugin) and the Aceternity "Tracing Beam" pattern for a scroll-linked line. Turn the trail off under prefers-reduced-motion and keep it under 40% opacity so it never fights the text.</p>
